WEBVTT

00:10:59.356 --> 00:11:01.277
that an asteroid killed the dinosaurs."

00:11:01.301 --> 00:11:02.689
(Laughter)

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.261
"Professor Hordley was brought up

00:11:07.285 --> 00:11:09.976
to have total and unquestioning faith" --

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.032
(Laughter) --

00:11:11.056 --> 00:11:15.852
"that an asteroid killed the dinosaurs."

00:11:18.459 --> 00:11:22.976
"Professor Hawkins has
promulgated an official dogma

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.444
binding on all loyal Hawkinsians

00:11:26.468 --> 00:11:29.337
that an asteroid killed the dinosaurs."

00:11:29.361 --> 00:11:31.301
(Laughter)